<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main id="main">
  <%- include('partials/page-hero', {
        crumbs: [{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: '/privacy-policy' }],
        heroTitle: 'Privacy Policy',
        heroText: 'How we collect, use and protect the information you share with us.'
      }) %>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <div class="prose">
        <p><em>Last updated: <%= fmtDate(new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]) %></em></p>

        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          This website is operated by <%= site.legalName %> ("<%= site.name %>", "we", "us"), a roofing contractor
          located at <%= site.address.street %>, <%= site.address.city %>, <%= site.address.region %> <%= site.address.postalCode %>.
          You can contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a> or <a href="tel:<%= site.phoneHref %>"><%= site.phone %></a>.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you voluntarily provide when you request a quote, book an inspection or contact us. This typically includes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name, email address and telephone number;</li>
          <li>The property address and details of the roofing work you are enquiring about;</li>
          <li>Any additional information you choose to include in a message.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We also collect limited, aggregated technical information automatically — such as pages visited and
          general location derived from your IP address — to understand how the site is used and to keep it secure.
        </p>

        <h2>3. How we use your information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your enquiry and provide a quotation or inspection;</li>
          <li>To schedule, deliver and follow up on roofing services;</li>
          <li>To communicate with you about your project;</li>
          <li>To comply with legal, insurance and accounting obligations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell, rent or trade your personal information to third parties.</p>

        <h2>4. Legal basis and your choices</h2>
        <p>
          We process your information on the basis of your consent and our legitimate interest in responding to
          your enquiry and delivering our services. You may withdraw consent or request that we stop contacting you
          at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a>.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain enquiry and project records only for as long as necessary to deliver our services, honour
          warranties and satisfy legal and accounting requirements. After that period, records are securely deleted.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Security</h2>
        <p>
          We use appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect the information we hold, including
          encrypted connections and restricted access. No method of transmission over the internet is entirely
          secure, but we take reasonable steps to safeguard your data.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This website uses only the cookies and local storage necessary for it to function correctly. We do not use
          cookies to build advertising profiles. You can control cookies through your browser settings at any time.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          We may use trusted third-party providers (for example, web hosting and email delivery) that process data on
          our behalf. These providers are required to protect your information and to use it only for the purposes we specify.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, delete or restrict the processing
          of your personal information. To exercise any of these rights, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a> and we will respond within a reasonable period.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised
          "last updated" date.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a> or call
          <a href="tel:<%= site.phoneHref %>"><%= site.phone %></a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/cta') %>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
